<span class="line"></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="route-groups" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#route-groups">#</a> Route Groups</h2>
<p>Organize routes with groups:</p>
<pre><code>src/routes/
├── (auth)/
│   ├── login/
│   └── register/
├── (dashboard)/
│   ├── overview/
│   └── settings/
└── api/
</code></pre>
<p>Parentheses <code>(name)</code> create route groups without adding to the URL path.</p>
<h2 id="layout-routes" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#layout-routes">#</a> Layout Routes</h2>
<p>Create layouts that wrap routes:</p>
<pre><code>src/routes/
├── +layout.ts           # Root layout
├── (dashboard)/
│   ├── +layout.ts       # Dashboard layout
│   ├── overview/
│   └── settings/
└── (auth)/
    ├── +layout.ts       # Auth layout
    ├── login/
    └── register/
</code></pre>
<p><code>+layout.ts</code> files automatically wrap child routes.</p>
